  "question": {
    "text": "An ideal gas has undergone through the cyclic process as shown in the figure. Work done by the gas in the entire cycle is ______ $\\times 10^{-1} \\mathrm{~J}$.<br/>(Take $\\pi=3.14$)<br/><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/jp25l97anhBmAPyAXJkz4m3S-871cQqP-bf-E95aPD0.original.fullsize.png\"/>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "314",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/yluOsT72LPxvbpSWdAKISafqm1yAIuDJXk_sMxenY38.original.fullsize.png\"/><br/>Area of circle, $\\mathrm{W}=\\frac{\\pi}{4} \\mathrm{~d}_1 \\mathrm{~d}_2$<br/>$\\mathrm{W}=\\frac{\\pi}{4}(500-300) \\times 10^3(350-150) \\times 10^{-6}$<br/>W = 31.4 Joule<br/>$\\mathrm{W}=314 \\times 10^{-1} \\mathrm{Joule}$",
    "image": null
  },
